  "details": "Please give us some sort of option to disable unwanted logs in the Debug UI. It's very cluttered with things that are not necessary when testing a world! For example, I might want to filter out everything except player join/leave messages and Debug.Log/Debug.LogWarning/Debug.LogError from Udon.\n\nI can see why some of these other logs might be useful for other creators, so it should definitely be some kind of option. Perhaps launch arguments?",
